  "protocol": "Isolated even-dimensional symmetric projected eigensolves, including device input reset. Original equation, full orthogonality and independent SciPy spectrum checked after one warmup and every measured replay. Same matrix per dimension/backend, with exact identity. Setup includes scratch allocation/construction/module loading where encountered, after input upload. Eager graph preparation plus first solve, subsequent outer capture, first captured replay and warmed replay are reported separately. Same process, cached compilation, fixed global-then-symmetric order; setup is not a cold-install comparison. No complete FEM speed claim. External occupancy required. Both backends retain the30-sweep bound and2e-15 diagonal-scaled stopping criterion. Symmetric variant restores symmetry after every sweep. Family selected in arguments. Production dispatch unchanged."
